6. ☑️ Error #2: ________________________________________________
7. ☑️ Error #3: ________________________________________________
8. ☑️ Error #4: ________________________________________________
9. ☑️ Error #5: ________________________________________________
10. ☑️ Total distinct errors: _____ (if < 5, use patch)
11. ☑️ Can I fix with Level 1 patch? (Yes/No) ____
12. ☑️ Can I fix with Level 2 patch? (Yes/No) ____
13. ☑️ Can I fix with Level 3 (function rewrite)? (Yes/No) ____
14. ☑️ Can I fix with Level 4 (section rewrite)? (Yes/No) ____
15. ☑️ Do I really need Level 5 (full rewrite)? (Yes/No) ____

**If answer to questions 5-9 is "No" (fewer than 5 errors) → USE PATCH, NOT REWRITE.**

**IF YOU SKIP THIS CHECKLIST, YOU FAIL IMMEDIATELY.**

